      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "### Panel Awaiting Configuration\n\nCalculating processing latency (e.g., time between a `pain` and its corresponding `pacs` message) requires advanced correlation.\n\nThis type of 'join' is complex in LogQL and may require:\n1.  Further log enrichment upstream to add the `pain` timestamp to the `pacs` log.\n2.  Using a different data source (e.g., Prometheus) where a service explicitly exports this latency as a metric.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
